std.parsyl — `ParseMaybe[T]`
============================

Tagged result of running a parser: **`Got(pos, value)`** or **`Miss`**. Parsers are
closures `(string, int) -> ParseMaybe[T]` (input string and cursor).

Combinators and `natural` live in sibling `.lsysl` files in this directory, same
`module std.parsyl`, so the generic enum and instantiated types are visible across
units after analysis.


    module std.parsyl

    enum ParseMaybe[T]
        Got(pos: int, value: T)
        Miss
